{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"c30ac2f7bf13aa3481c3e5bddbc93265207681920c68cc28b9b0c2e434bc27a1","ja":"白熱していく練習！","zh":"练习愈发激烈！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9df954e4e88a9e89136ae85fad23cef736f512fea507ed8dc93f470f0de048ec","ja":"お芝居のお手伝いか……ええ、分かったわ。\n今日のお仕事は終わったし、大丈夫よ。","zh":"来给排戏帮个忙吗……嗯，我明白了。\n今天的工作已经结束了，没问题的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7d4158d3c36e9a2c8016aaa29446a0d291292df2df85fb876e6a399b680092bd","ja":"それで、私はどんな役なのかしら？\nやっぱり、セクシーでモテモテな城主の娘とか……。","zh":"那么，我是扮演什么样的角色呢？\n果然是性感又大受欢迎的城主千金之类……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9620c0b80ac530077aea96d4d04a510d4671a7710cd40d2ad40316d658b03545","ja":"いえ、莉緒さんには、昴ちゃんと歩さんをまとめる\n悪の親分役をお願いします！","zh":"不，莉绪小姐，我想拜托你来演带领\n小昴和步小姐的反派头目！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"2b1a74a36bf7081dd7abf44667c135ecd23ebb95ec6173026fb1ea7e35ec880f","ja":"えっ、ちょっと待って！　私が悪の親分なの！？","zh":"诶，等等！我是反派大头领吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"372c363e39c824324ffcdee2cef739471a19ab2c702468439184bccb4d9e6229","ja":"や、やっぱり、ダメでしょうか……？","zh":"还、还是不行吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1e8a241ee3d431791d33ef73d06810aebcae1378b644d0cc1a745a6755e9e266","ja":"そ、そんなに真っ直ぐな目で\n見つめられちゃうと……。","zh":"被、被你用这么直率的眼神\n凝视着的话……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b8debca6fd999330980a7304311900d287f07bbb4f2ff1a2d8657fd82c9cf0dd","ja":"もう、しょうがないわね～。\nお姉さんに任せなさい！","zh":"真拿你没办法呢～。\n交给大姐姐吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3ecd2a4ed98ada795642ddc4884d4bb341f5eb065295cb42f18b540190b68b72","ja":"「お前たち、待たせたわね！」\nえっと……次はどうすればいいのかしら……？","zh":"“让你们久等了！”\n那个……接下来该怎么做好呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"6e7c45d41bd7e972da3d9071d080de288699b2ed13fb7f22afdcaf4037964e51","ja":"「親分、お待ちしておりました！」","zh":"“老大，我一直在等您！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"60479609453a8a1959cf44913060f2a5159b8fafb537fb12430a2812ed6b6c36","ja":"莉緒親分！　台本をどうぞ！","zh":"莉绪老大！请看剧本！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8928d9eba80a58ddee2e8b828ca6e4429a97d079bcb80cf59dc0b1ca15f75dcc","ja":"ありがと。えーっと……\n「さて、ここからは3対1だよ。覚悟することだね！」","zh":"谢谢。呃……\n“那么，从现在开始就是3对1了。做好觉悟吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"be0ebd15cf158d9e9aa319dd6ccd8e53846c8f730c15380716460bc49ce722e2","ja":"「いくわよ、お前たち！」","zh":"“要上咯，你们几个！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"84d0543ee5d0c6ec8d91a2365e165c40ac8f41087d1733b0c4923042ae12ffe3","ja":"「親分のご命令だ！　悪く思うなよ！」","zh":"「这是老大的命令！可别怪我啊！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a7abfefc9ed10c66c096a5f7259da586093cf5a7e6f5ceb78d2ffec0985832dc","ja":"「オレたちに勝とうなんて、100年早いんだよ！\nとりゃぁぁぁぁぁっ！」","zh":"「想赢我们，还早了100年呢！\n看招啊啊啊啊啊！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1297.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"4eca90b55f397af642c9affee00051971774b7d4231f1882f16863dd581c4e7f","ja":"「私に楯突いた自分を悔やみな！\nはぁぁぁぁぁっ！」","zh":"「为反抗我的自己后悔去吧！\n哈啊啊啊啊啊！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
